1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,792
As Uke comes to grab your wrist with both hands

2
00:00:02,793 --> 00:00:03,864
extend towards him

3
00:00:03,865 --> 00:00:07,278
using his momentum bring his body around 
in a big circular motion

4
00:00:07,679 --> 00:00:10,758
continue that movement 
so it comes round to the opposite hand

5
00:00:10,759 --> 00:00:12,877
turn again in a big circular movement,

6
00:00:13,478 --> 00:00:15,534
as he comes up to regain his balance,

7
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:17,908
control his wrist against your chest

8
00:00:18,209 --> 00:00:20,551
compress the wrist forward into his body

9
00:00:20,852 --> 00:00:22,275
as Uke goes down

10
00:00:22,276 --> 00:00:25,577
turn, controlling his wrist and his elbow,

11
00:00:25,978 --> 00:00:27,912
pin the shoulder down to the mat

12
00:00:27,913 --> 00:00:29,966
placing his shoulder in between the knees,

13
00:00:29,967 --> 00:00:31,948
control his arm against your body

14
00:00:31,949 --> 00:00:34,047
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

